{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Carriages and Conversations","paragraph":365,"wording":"[Trapmaster Assassin]","event":"named","holder-slug":"trapmaster-assassin","holder-quote":"It seemed like people stayed on safe topics here. Soon, everyone was discussing the battle. The [Trapmaster Assassin] was sighing.","id":"3d427b0f-5294-5480-a4cf-521c76bd9a53"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Carriages and Conversations","paragraph":395,"wording":"[Trapmaster Assassin]","event":"named","holder-slug":"trapmaster-assassin","holder-quote":"To their surprise, she looked at the [Assassin] instead of the Brother, and the [Trapmaster Assassin] just raised his hands. Ryoka and Fierre didn’t know what to say to that.","id":"edf0d163-dc47-5a9e-b910-62da4e2cc06b"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Carriages and Conversations","paragraph":438,"wording":"[Trapmaster Assassin]","event":"named","holder-slug":"trapmaster-assassin","holder-quote":"The Brother and [Trapmaster Assassin] stopped at the same destination, or close enough that they were lumped together. The [Thug] tipped his hat to the [Assassin] as the coach rolled off.","id":"d4d7956f-2325-5497-a555-f1bfb7166b98"}
